Hermes Agent 0.22.4, commit 4d04303818b61bf3aa09278af48356315515965b
Patches originally derived from Hermes Agent 0.21.5, commit f97608f178d1ffeca59860195ab7da295f7c8e5f
https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent

AstraBox patch: typed per-Session tool environment on the canonical gateway's
session.create and session.resume, held in the session owner's memory, bound
to that session's turns through a native ContextVar, and applied by the
existing child-process environment builder. The supplier agent loop,
SessionDB, admission ledger and lifecycle remain native.

AstraBox patch: distinguish configured A2A peer keys from discovery URLs and
propagate Agent Card errors before dispatch. Direct URLs do not inherit a
configured peer's credentials.

